                  "label": "mucopurulent discharge is greater in newborns"
                },
                {
                  "label": "pseudomembranes can develop on tarsal conjunctiva in newborns"
                },
                {
                  "label": "intracytoplasmic inclusions are seen in a greater percentage of Giemsa-stained conjunctival specimens in newborns"
                },
                {
                  "label": "infection in newborns is more likely to respond to topical medications"
